	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Cannon to the left of them, cannon to the right of them, cannon in front of them volleyed and thundered. Stormed at with shot and shell bravely they rode, and well, into the Jaws of Death, into the Mouth of Hell, rode the six hundred.</p><p>While the brave men of the Light Brigade never questioned their orders and took up that fateful charge from which so many would never return, it was the cannonade, and the commanders ordering the volley and thunder, who would see the end of the light brigade.</p><p><strong>Table: Cannonade</strong></p><table style=\"width: 100%; height: 105.359px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 41.8738%;\"><col style=\"width: 58.1262%;\"></colgroup><thead><tr style=\"text-align: center; height: 16.7969px;\"><td style=\"height: 16.7969px;\">Level</td><td style=\"height: 16.7969px;\">Features</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"text-align: center; height: 21.375px;\"><td style=\"height: 21.375px;\">3rd</td><td style=\"height: 21.375px;\">@UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.zq511aOXNw3b6aQS]{Bonus Proficiencies} @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.95SO9gpCE7cDzFCS]{Volley}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center; height: 16.7969px;\"><td style=\"height: 16.7969px;\">7th</td><td style=\"height: 16.7969px;\">@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.AsExliCxkHv9uTdN]{Thunder}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center; height: 16.7969px;\"><td style=\"height: 16.7969px;\">11th</td><td style=\"height: 16.7969px;\">@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.kBrGAF798JOURBzt]{Gunnery Master}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center; height: 16.7969px;\"><td style=\"height: 16.7969px;\">15th</td><td style=\"height: 16.7969px;\">@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.pOn50BcB0pQkiowh]{Storm and Shell}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center; height: 16.7969px;\"><td style=\"text-align: center; height: 16.7969px;\">18th</td><td style=\"height: 16.7969px;\">@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-clas